{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1788865288000-7b5bd3", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "会议室经常被同一批人长期占用怎么办？", "id": "e20e9f256283410a8af4113fcb685fcd", "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:01:28", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "e88a7185ac39412fbeafd8942fb91812", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:01:28", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "20daa508ae844e988c59f037f4e3fcb7", "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:01:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-08T11:02:08"}, {"type": "text", "text": "三条治理措施：\n1. 企微-会议室预订改为**单次最长 2 小时**，循环会议需每周重新预订；\n2. 预订后 15 分钟未签到自动释放；\n3. 每月导出使用率，连续 4 周 <30% 的固定预订由行政回收。\n先发通知一周再执行。", "id": "2dc2d70df53242a89769a9e97ffb4b9f", "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:01:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-08T11:02:08"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "66a2ce06326a48979dfaa170d04de1d2", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:01:36", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-08T11:02:08", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "帮写这封通知。", "id": "13e02adf6fcf49429f3041810b04bd30", "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:04:28", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "91f4a10060fc4183994083e2fd26e86f", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:04:28", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "027c535dce5f42469efe8925132cee58", "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:04:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-08T11:05:08"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**关于会议室预订新规的通知**\n各位同事：\n自 X 月 X 日起，会议室预订执行：单次≤2 小时；开始 15 分钟未签到自动释放；循环会议每周重新预订。现有固定预订请于本周五前重新登记，逾期未登记的将由行政统一回收。\n给大家带来不便敬请谅解。\n——行政部", "id": "5ad0a4351d8a4af59e80c8efb6b09200", "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:04:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-08T11:05:08"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "b81661e0abe646bd9f183e38d8e3f847", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:04:36", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-08T11:05:08", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "预订系统有现成的吗？还是要开发？", "id": "40f1b093c86942cdbbc90384d874cf5f", "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:07:08", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "221ab8ecce7547bf91074020ff498a25", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:07:08", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "558bc05b25884b5c833b3d98e4cc17cf", "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:07:14", "finished_at": "2026-09-08T11:07:53"}, {"type": "text", "text": "企微自带「会议室」应用，零开发：后台导入 3 间会议室，设置 2 小时上限和签到释放规则即可，半天上线。够用后再考虑专业系统。", "id": "c233e3cbed5c4568aa9134ac7aae86a4", "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:07:14", "finished_at": "2026-09-08T11:07:53"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "579989a1cb8640a4912aade6835b16e3", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-08T11:07:14", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-08T11:07:53", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}